It includes work derived from Herdr (https://herdr.dev,
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), also under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. These files were cloned from Herdr 0.1.14 and changed:

- core/layouts/standard.json: Herdr's `main` layout. The install build adds
  the profile switcher to it.
- core/mods/standard-files/: Herdr's `files` mod. Markdown files open
  rendered, with links and images.
- core/mods/standard-tabs/: Herdr's `tabs` mod. A History button and a
  Terminal button (the bottom terminal).

upstream/ keeps Herdr's own originals of those three, unchanged, from the
version named in upstream/herdr.json, to compare a new Herdr against.

The SVG icons in core/mods/standard-files/, core/mods/standard-history/,
core/mods/standard-tabs/ and upstream/mods/ are Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev), as shipped
with Herdr: ISC License, some derived from Feather under the MIT License.
